# Nirvana Impex — Environment Variables
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in the values before running.
# Never commit .env to version control.
# See README.md for setup instructions.

# ── Email submission (Formspree) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# VITE_FORMSPREE_ID is the form ID from your Formspree account.
# It is NOT a secret — it is a public submission key used in browser code.
# Example ID: xpwzdabc
#
# Setup:
#   1. Create a free account at https://formspree.io
#   2. Create a new form and verify your email address
#   3. Copy the form ID from the form's integration tab
#   4. Paste it here (without the full URL — just the ID portion)
#
# Formspree free plan: 50 submissions per month, 1 form
# Paid plans available for higher volume
#
# If this value is empty, the email submission channel is disabled and
# a clear configuration message is shown to visitors.
#
VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=

# ── WhatsApp click-to-chat ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# VITE_WHATSAPP_NUMBER is the company WhatsApp number in international format,
# digits only — no +, no spaces, no dashes.
#
# Example for +91 98765 43210: 919876543210
#
# This value is embedded in the WhatsApp click-to-chat URL in browser code.
# It is visible to anyone who inspects the page. Do not use a personal number
# if you want to keep it private from the general public.
#
# If this value is empty, the WhatsApp submission channel is disabled and
# a clear configuration message is shown to visitors.
#
VITE_WHATSAPP_NUMBER=

# ── Optional: public display email ────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# VITE_CONTACT_EMAIL can be used to display the company's enquiry address
# in the footer or about page, once verified.
#
# This will be visible in browser source. Do not put a private address here
# if you want to prevent automated harvesting.
#
# Leave empty until a verified address is available.
#
VITE_CONTACT_EMAIL=
